PC311-W-TY/R/N helps you monitor the amount of electricity Consumed and Produced in your single-phase power system by connecting the clamp on to the power cable. It allows you to turn On/Off of relay and check real-time or historical energy data via mobile App.

## Key Features

- Tuya compliant. Support automation with other Tuya device
- Single-Phase electricity system Suitable
- Remotely monitor a single-phase circuit, with 1 current transformers
- Wireless communication via Wi-Fi 2.4GHz
- Real-time Voltage, Current, PowerFactor, ActivePower, Frequency, measurement
- Bidirectional measurement: Energy Usage / Solar Production
- Historical data can be displayed and exported in the App
- Dry contact relay, resistive current rated 10A, max.16A, overload protection and relay setting
